## /security-review — loop U2, round 2, range 52100f5a..c5c457a6

No high-confidence vulnerabilities found. The escape fix is complete: `parseIndex` (plan.ts:66) strips C0 (except \t, \n), DEL and C1 from the raw file before parsing, so title, status, unit rows, run-log rows and gap bullets are clean. Folder names match `[a-z0-9-]` only; agent descriptions are matched, never drawn; `process.run` takes an argument array with no shell; no eval, dynamic import or deserialization.
